SUMMARY:HEAD 2 HEAD: Kidz Movie Poll
DESCRIPTION:It's time to vote!! A kid's voting station has been set up in 
 the children's area at the South Regional Library.\n\nWhat is your favorite 
 version of Snow White? Is it the animated Disney movie (1937) or the Disney 
 live action film (2025)? Let us know!\n\nThe winning movie will be selected 
 for Kidz Movie Madness which will be on Saturday\, May 30th at 11am. Who 
 will win?? You decide!!! Voting ends on Thursday\, April 30th. Only one 
 vote per patron\, please. Come on out and Vote!!
LOCATION:South Regional - Children's Area\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Donielle F.":MAILTO:dlfonville@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Announcements, Movie
