SUMMARY:Stay Focused -- The Science of Self-Control
DESCRIPTION:We have all struggled with willpower and self-control. In this 
 session of Stay Focused\, we'll watch a video showing the scientific basis 
 for why self-control is so difficult\, and then have a group discussion to 
 swap ideas. If you'd like to come away with some helpful strategies\, 
